            <title>[LU-21280] sanity-quota test_85: dd hangs in sync write with least_qunit on b2_15 ZFS, suite times out</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21280</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for Patrickbot &amp;lt;patrick-bot@mulberrytree.us&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/daffa538-7386-4be0-a952-d52188c498f4" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/daffa538-7386-4be0-a952-d52188c498f4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_85 failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Timeout occurred after 203 minutes, last suite running was sanity-quota
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session details:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Client&lt;br/&gt;
Lustre: 2.15.8.22&lt;br/&gt;
Branch: b2_15&lt;br/&gt;
Build: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/137210" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/137210&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Kernel: 4.18.0-553.158.1.el8_10.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Server&lt;br/&gt;
Lustre: 2.15.8.22&lt;br/&gt;
Branch: b2_15&lt;br/&gt;
Build: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/137210" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/137210&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Kernel: 4.18.0-553.158.1.el8_lustre.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;sanity-quota test_85 (do not hung at write with the least_qunit) hangs on b2_15 with ZFS OSTs until the suite timeout. The dd run as uid 60000 is stuck in vvp_io_write_commit -&amp;gt; vvp_io_commit_sync -&amp;gt; cl_io_submit_sync -&amp;gt; cl_sync_io_wait (sync write after quota pool setup), and the suite is killed after 203 minutes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Seen on b2_15 only so far: Janitor Rocky 8.10 zfs sanity-quota test_85 TIMEOUT 2026-11-12 (j:71410), 2026-11-14 (j:71415), 2026-11-15 (j:71417), and lustre-reviews review-zfs el8.10 on change 70945 patchset 3 (session 825a8bbd-812d-4839-b592-dbb9bb6a9948, build 137210) on 2026-11-20. That change only touches sanity.sh test_27T and adds an OST fail_loc that sanity-quota never sets, so it does not cause this. Master and b2_16 runs of test_85 pass (master review-zfs 1301/1301 passes); master-next had two unrelated ldiskfs quota setup failures in the same test.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Raised by Patch Watcher run pw-engineer-70945-ps4-a6f57d9a764b on &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/70945" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/70945&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
